{"4802220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SnorQ", "steam_appid": 4802220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SnorQ is more than just a game it's a journey toward the light we all encounter throughout our lives.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Light your path </strong>through over 50 Always different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Shine a Light on your path </strong>as you face countless enemies, some darker and more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Shine brightly </strong>against fearsome bosses determined to extinguish your light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Unleash your energy </strong>with active and passive combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Enhance your power </strong>by combining a wide range of upgrades to create unique synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Unlock permanent abilities </strong>that will make your character stronger and more versatile, allowing you to discover the strategy that best lights your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Discover all the collectibles</strong> hidden in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Bring your light to SnorQ </strong>and defeat him: he desires nothing but darkness for you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SnorQ is more than just a game it's a journey toward the light we all encounter throughout our lives.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Light your path </strong>through over 50 Always different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Shine a Light on your path </strong>as you face countless enemies, some darker and more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Shine brightly </strong>against fearsome bosses determined to extinguish your light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Unleash your energy </strong>with active and passive combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Enhance your power </strong>by combining a wide range of upgrades to create unique synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Unlock permanent abilities </strong>that will make your character stronger and more versatile, allowing you to discover the strategy that best lights your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Discover all the collectibles</strong> hidden in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Bring your light to SnorQ </strong>and defeat him: he desires nothing but darkness for you!</p>", "short_description": "SnorQ wants turn off your light. Don't let him! Rise to the surface, unlock abilities, pick the right bonuses and collect light crystals. SnorQ and his creatures will do anything to keep you in the dark. A dark pixel art roguelite, with local co-op for up to 2 players.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4802220/0553f4e0ffa282770d0339490ee9fba4f1887b15/header.jpg?t=1786120127", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4802220/18b21c83d831052f6699a5a5214398625bfa332a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786120127", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4802220/18b21c83d831052f6699a5a5214398625bfa332a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786120127", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minim